                                                "sense_id": "a91b978d-5895-3921-bade-909bf9a796d2",
                                                "text": "Daytime interests are clearly not such far-reaching psychical sources of dreams as might have been expected from the categorical assertions that everyone continues to carry on his daily business in his dreams."
